{
  "sequence_id": "seq_b136f32c2233b97c",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hi"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Pochita..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I'll probably get myself killed fighting devils before long."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "MANGA STREAM,OM DO NOT MIRROR"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If that happens, I'm worried about what'll happen to you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You might starve to death,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "or maybe get taken out by another devil hunter."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I heard there are devils who can take over dead people's bodies."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "If you can do that..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Then I'll give ya my body..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "After I'm in my grave, the Yakuza'LL forget about me."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "You can leave this town..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "And then..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "It'd be nice if you could have a normal life"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "and die a normal death."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "MANGA STREANDS: Do not mirror"
    }
  ],
